@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Off

state Off
state ActiveAlarm
state RingingAlarm
state SilentAlarm

Off --> ActiveAlarm : set alarm time
ActiveAlarm --> RingingAlarm : current time matches alarm time
RingingAlarm --> SilentAlarm : user stops alarm
SilentAlarm --> ActiveAlarm : next scheduled alarm time
@enduml
